<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-INDIA WIN TOSS AND BAT AGAINST ZIMBABWE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA WIN TOSS AND BAT AGAINST ZIMBABWE.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>India won the toss and chose to</p>
<p>bat in the day/night triangular series match against Zimbabwe at</p>
<p>Centurion Park on Friday.</p>
<p>Teams:</p>
<p>India: Sachin Tendulkar (captain), Saurav Ganguly, Rahul</p>
<p>Dravid, Mohammad Azharuddin, Ajay Jadeja, Robin Singh, Saba</p>
<p>Karim, Javagal Srinath, Salil Ankola, Anil Kumble, Venkatesh</p>
<p>Prasad.</p>
<p>Zimbabwe: Grant Flower, Andy Waller, Andy Flower, Alistair</p>
<p>Campbell (captain), Dave Houghton, Craig Evans, Guy Whittall,</p>
<p>Paul Strang, Heath Streak, Eddo Brandes, John Rennie.</p>
</text>
